<h3><u>Akbar ka laasha</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Akbar ka lasha dekhke khud mar gae hussain&nbsp;<br />
zalim toh bus hussain pe khanjar chalaaega<br />
<br />
1. Atthara saal wale ka lasha utha liya<br />
aisa laga ke apna janaza utha lia<br />
akbar ke khun se ban me wuzu kar gae hussain<br />
<br />
2. Barchi ka phal yeh kaisa rago me ulaj gaya<br />
barchi nikalne pe kaleja bhi kat gaya<br />
sakhtey me aa gaye isi dard se hussain<br />
<br />
3. Laila ki hasrato ka janaza nikal gaya<br />
sugra ki khwahisho ka<br />
akbar ne barchi khayi magar mar gae hussain<br />
<br />
4. Tu kya gaya ke meri basarat chali gai<br />
tere hi sath jeene ki chahat chali gayi<br />
beta dhadakna bhul gaya hai dile hussain<br />
<br />
5. Khaime ke dar pe pahuche toh awaaz di yahi<br />
zainab uthalo aakar meri laash hai padi<br />
akbar ke saath katl waha ho gaye hussain<br />
<br />
6. Akbar ka gum uthakar mera haal hai yahi<br />
mai toh bus ek badan hu meri jaa nikal gayi<br />
raftaar dekho lafz ki bejaan hai hussain<br />
<br />
7. Bhai ka haal dekha to zainab tadap gayi<br />
bete ke ghum me haalat hui kya hussain&nbsp;<br />
khune pisar me kis tarah galta hue hussain<br />
<br />
8. Farhan ho ke mazhar bayaan kya kare koi&nbsp;<br />
maa ne pisar ke lashe pe faryaad ki yahi<br />
ai laal saath tere jahaa se gaye hussain</p>
</p>
               
                
                                
            

  
            	
